// BT-4001: `class_side_super_test.bt` overrides `peek:` on this class with a
// class-side extension that sends `super peek:`. This class's own `run` sends
// `super peek:` too and must reach the superclass's method, not that
// extension.

Bt4001ClassSuperExtBase subclass: Bt4001ClassSuperExtChild

  class run => super peek: 1
